---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT k, n FROM (SELECT a + 1 AS k, count(*) AS n FROM t GROUP BY a + 1) WHERE k > 2 AND n > 1"
---
Filter (n#4 > 1)
+- Aggregate [(a#0 + 1)], [(a#0 + 1) AS k#3, count(1) AS n#4]
   +- Filter ((a#0 + 1) > 2)
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
